      "message": "Thank you for your feedback.\n\nThe FRB2 watchdog is the BIOS boot watchdog. BIOS arms it at POST starts, and BIOS disarms it when POST completes. If BIOS hangs during POST, the timer expires and the BMC logs an FRB2 watchdog event.",
